                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a10faee7-dafd-3311-abe3-683899c2db47",
                                        "entry_id": "dd9b562f-a5b3-3787-8ec9-00de6a60f283",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Misserfolg; etwas, das nicht gelungen ist"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dd94d44-ee94-4609-9fa7-b84701debb57",
                                                "sense_id": "a10faee7-dafd-3311-abe3-683899c2db47",
                                                "text": "Das neue Produkt der Firma XY wurde ein Flop."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e8b40cb5-4d83-4882-924a-87e02aaab204",
                                                "sense_id": "a10faee7-dafd-3311-abe3-683899c2db47",
                                                "text": "Mit seinem Witz sorgt Tim für einen Flop."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17e823fa-87b7-4bbc-ab78-6b1690aef149",
                                                "sense_id": "a10faee7-dafd-3311-abe3-683899c2db47",
                                                "text": "„Aber erneut eine Redaktionsleitung für einen literarischen Flop, den Tausch wäre die Verlagsleitung wohl doch nicht eingegangen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb4c12a8-94dd-4cca-a5db-dbb625325d18",
                                                "sense_id": "a10faee7-dafd-3311-abe3-683899c2db47",
                                                "text": "„Die eigenen großen Ideen entpuppen sich als Flops, der Weg nach oben ist doch steiniger, als man meinte, die glänzende Zukunft, die man sich vorgestellt hat, schwindet zusehends.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b44593b9-4ec2-4c9e-8f5d-dd05ec3985be",
                        "source_entry_id": "3e9f7f68-7c54-3baf-9abd-0027d4caedc3",
                        "source_sense_id": "0a1c9c0c-1a99-3abc-bdbd-a04b921b7df0",
                        "source_sense_description": "Échec complet",
                        "target_lang_word": "Fiasko",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Fiasko",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5353a00-2b34-3335-aa25-b29223cbb22e",
                                        "entry_id": "c87fdb35-de55-3ecc-812b-212cdd5a8936",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Misserfolg, Reinfall, soziale oder wirtschaftliche Katastrophe"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cad16556-8b60-4102-a5a6-f81d85e00869",
                                                "sense_id": "e5353a00-2b34-3335-aa25-b29223cbb22e",
                                                "text": "Die Aufführung endete in einem Fiasko, als die Sopranistin sich in den Orchestergraben erbrach."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c964f291-2a15-4833-aa45-f84434bd2852",
                                                "sense_id": "e5353a00-2b34-3335-aa25-b29223cbb22e",
                                                "text": "Der Intendant verließ angesichts des Fiaskos tränenüberströmt den Saal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "73b39d58-fe18-4f64-b915-cdda989bf983",
                                                "sense_id": "e5353a00-2b34-3335-aa25-b29223cbb22e",
                                                "text": "Nach den unüberlegten Übernahmeaktivitäten der Heuschreck AG droht den Anlegern ein Fiasko."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b3c126c-ed3e-4fbb-bee2-40178362593d",
                                                "sense_id": "e5353a00-2b34-3335-aa25-b29223cbb22e",
                                                "text": "„Unter diesen ungünstigen Umständen meine Kandidatur anzukündigen, würde Ihre Stellung schwächen und vielleicht in einem Fiasko enden, über das sich meine Gegner nur freuen würden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4dbc74ab-b215-47dd-b129-fff7e8ba6e6d",
                                                "sense_id": "e5353a00-2b34-3335-aa25-b29223cbb22e",
                                                "text": "„Die Vormittagssitzung war dank Kaletzki ein Fiasko gewesen, die Nachmittagssitzung zwar erfolgreich - aber für die falschen Leute.“."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e443f26f-f4b1-4ca4-9043-d25b76fc2a91",
                                                "sense_id": "e5353a00-2b34-3335-aa25-b29223cbb22e",
                                                "text": "„Es gab von Beginn an warnende Stimmen, daß ein derartiges Projekt im Fiasko enden mußte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "377f4710-9dfc-4c91-b41b-1d4c0bf55c54",
                                                "sense_id": "e5353a00-2b34-3335-aa25-b29223cbb22e",
                                                "text": "„Ich begegnete anderen Fiaskos, und die jeweilige Frau, die mir nahe stand, war nicht immer das Glück auf Erden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f04f6cb2-f105-44cf-bb0f-666eec27cbb0",
                        "source_entry_id": "3e9f7f68-7c54-3baf-9abd-0027d4caedc3",
                        "source_sense_id": "0a1c9c0c-1a99-3abc-bdbd-a04b921b7df0",
                        "source_sense_description": "Échec complet",
                        "target_lang_word": "fiasco",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fiasco",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6e323c6b-885f-3952-8f56-d7fd2d982cae",
                                        "entry_id": "9442e23b-fabd-3679-b95b-c4e34f9fa66b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sudden or unexpected failure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e11e225-7bc8-4bd1-8fac-31343a4720df",
                                                "sense_id": "6e323c6b-885f-3952-8f56-d7fd2d982cae",
                                                "text": "The event turned into a complete fiasco when the power went out."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "970dbe76-0738-4e23-8526-482630125071",
                                                "sense_id": "6e323c6b-885f-3952-8f56-d7fd2d982cae",
                                                "text": "His speech was a fiasco that left the audience confused."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8382c60a-5d19-4aeb-9868-f671a60e122c",
                                                "sense_id": "6e323c6b-885f-3952-8f56-d7fd2d982cae",
                                                "text": "\"Well, doctor,\" said Mr. Curtis, heartily, \"I am glad for your sake that the financial part of the enterprise has succeeded so well, because, the more I think over the scheme, the more I am convinced that it will prove a complete fiasco in practice. And that reminds me that there is one question which I wish to ask you.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "09f2d55f-f9ae-3a16-b5cf-550170e76891",
                                        "entry_id": "9442e23b-fabd-3679-b95b-c4e34f9fa66b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A ludicrous or humiliating situation. Some effort that went quite wrong."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00bb5bcf-eb9d-4427-851f-83db2d08fa23",
                                                "sense_id": "09f2d55f-f9ae-3a16-b5cf-550170e76891",
                                                "text": "There was the fiasco about Olga coming to the tableaux, which was the cause of her sending that very tart reply, via Miss Lyall, to Lady Ambermere's impertinence, and the very next morning, Lady Ambermere, coming again into Riseholme, perhaps for that very purpose, had behaved to Lucia as Lucia had behaved to the moon, and cut her. That was irritating, but the counter-irritant to it had been that Lady Ambermere had then gone to Olga's, and been told that she was not at home, though she was very audibly practising in her music-room at the time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24bb98e8-fac6-35ec-aced-ec0fdf476c61",
                                        "entry_id": "9442e23b-fabd-3679-b95b-c4e34f9fa66b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A wine bottle in a (usually straw) jacket."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46f6a304-e7f1-4ccb-8ddc-7c572dd70f3b",
                                                "sense_id": "24bb98e8-fac6-35ec-aced-ec0fdf476c61",
                                                "text": "I sent for the porter and when he came I told him in Italian to get me a bottle of Cinzano at the wine shop, a fiasco of chianti and the evening papers. He went away and brought them wrapped in newspaper, unwrapped them and, when I asked him to, drew the corks and put the wine and vermouth under the bed."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b0aa1bac-731a-496b-abdd-ffafa7ae3cde",
                        "source_entry_id": "3e9f7f68-7c54-3baf-9abd-0027d4caedc3",
